            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Ammonia (NH₃) is an important industrial compound of nitrogen, which is mainly used as a fertilizer. It is prepared industrially by Haber-Bosch process."
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\ce{N2_{(g)} + 3H2_{(g)} <=>[\\Delta] 2NH3_{(g)}}",
            "text_alt": "N₂(g) + 3H₂(g) ⇌(Δ) 2NH₃(g)"
          }
        ]
      }
